# The Davoi Report (San d'Oria 2-2), Grilau's route. A level 10 Warrior of San d'Oria with 1-1 completed (a GM;
# Resonance current keeps RoV 1-1 out), in Northern San d'Oria. Grilau's script plays 1009 (section 1); its finish
# with option 104 begins the mission. Status 0: Grilau answers Northern San d'Oria's ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 44, and
# a trigger straight after a text plays his script's 1001; status 2 (a GM) answers the text again. Status 3: not
# completed, so 1028 with the arguments 0, 0, 0, 44 (no handler finishes it). The mission completed through the Papal
# Chambers door (350 rank points) and then current again at status 3 with the report (GMs): completed, so Grilau plays
# 1006, whose finish completes the mission again and takes the report.
# Rival zone-in, another mission's script: the login in Northern San d'Oria plays Seekers of Adventure's Rumors from the
# West onZoneIn, which returns 878 (the trace records only that return, with no event packet).
lists NorthernSanDoria/Grilau/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1009 NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/1006 NorthernSanDoria/_6fc/onTrigger NorthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/695
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=-240.5,7,57.9 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=0
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
login
trigger Grilau                          # section 1: his script's 1009
finish option=104                       # begun
trigger Grilau                          # status 0: Northern ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 44
finish-if-event
trigger Grilau                          # straight after a text: his script's 1001
finish-if-event
missionstatus Sandoria 2                # a GM
trigger Grilau                          # status 2: Northern ORIGINAL_MISSION_OFFSET + 44
finish-if-event
missionstatus Sandoria 3                # a GM
trigger Grilau                          # status 3, not completed: 1028
finish-if-event
keyitem TempleKnightsDavoiReport
warp 131,-11,122 NorthernSanDoria
trigger _6fc                            # not completed, the report held: 695
finish                                  # completed (350 rank points), the report taken
mission Sandoria TheDavoiReport current # a GM
missionstatus Sandoria 3
keyitem TempleKnightsDavoiReport
warp -240.5,7,57.9 NorthernSanDoria
trigger Grilau                          # status 3, completed: 1006
finish                                  # completed again, the report taken
